FocalLoss defined.
Why Focal Loss > Weighted CE for this dataset:
  Weighted CE: every Normal sample contributes full CE loss even when correctly predicted
  Focal Loss : correctly-predicted Normal -> (1-p)^2 ~ 0 -> nearly no gradient
               misclassified rare class -> stays high -> model must learn rare patterns
